        "line": 991,
        "text": "theorem mixed_jet_bound (P : Patch) (N : ℕ) : ∃ J : ℝ, 0 < J ∧ ∀ k ≤ N, ∀ (m : ℕ) (v : ℝ → Coeff) (eta : ℝ), ContDiffAt ℝ ∞ v eta → ∀ x : ℝ, ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ m (fun p => iteratedDeriv k (u P (v p)) x) eta‖ ≤ J * ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ m v eta‖ ∧ … (same for e P)"
